    {
      "@id": "#evidence",
      "@type": "Evidence",
      "title": "[[RES]] - 29% of MATSUlab issues (n=445) were claimed as experiments - [[@analysis/quantify issue claiming from MATSUlab]]",
      "content": "Issue-to-experiment conversion rate and result production. The proportion of issues posted to a discourse graph Issues board that are claimed as experiments, and the subsequent proportion of those claimed experiments that produce formal result nodes. Measured across 445 issues, 130 claimed experiments, and 139 RES nodes in the MATSUlab discourse graph.",
      "created": "2026-02-14",
      "creator": "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0286-5310",
      "has_container": "./",
      "description": "README.md",
