    {
      "@id": "fig1_conversion_rate.png",
      "@type": [
        "Item",
        "schema:ImageObject"
      ],
      "format": "image/png",
      "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {
        "@id": "#study"
      },
      "schema:caption": "Figure 1. 29% of MATSUlab issues (n=445) were claimed as experiments, and 15% of those were claimed by a different lab member than the issue creator. (Left) Stacked horizontal bar showing the composition of all 445 issues: explicitly claimed (69, blue), inferred claiming (56, green), ISS with activity (5, amber), unclaimed (315, grey). Bracket indicates total claimed: 130 (29.2%). (Right) Donut chart showing claiming authorship among 125 claimed experiments: self-claimed (106, 85%) and cross-person claiming (19, 15%)."
    },
